{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32061","headline":"贺庞少尹除太常少卿 · 贾岛","name":"贺庞少尹除太常少卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太白山前终日见，十旬假满拟秋寻。\n中峰绝顶非无路，北阙除书阻入林。\n朝谒此时闲野屐，宿斋何处止鸣砧？\n省中石镫陪随步，唯赏烟霞不厌深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}